    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25914" root="ضفر" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَفِيرٌ</span></b>  <i>A rope of</i> [<i>goats'</i>] <i>hair,</i> (Mgh, Msb, TA,)
<i>twisted:</i> of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعِيلٌ</span> in the sense of the
measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْعُولٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And (assumed tropical:)  The <i>shore,</i> or
<i>side,</i> of the sea or of a great river; (O, K, * TA;;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَفِيرَةٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

